### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### 2. 투표하기 - 정상 요청 (짜장)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "choice": "jajang",
  "voterId": "user-123"
}

### 3. 투표하기 - 정상 요청 (짬뽕)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "choice": "jjamppong",
  "voterId": "user-456"
}

### 4. 투표하기 - 중복 voterId 테스트 (409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "choice": "jajang",
  "voterId": "user-123"
}

### 5. 투표하기 - 잘못된 choice 값 전달 테스트 (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "choice": "tangsooyook",
  "voterId": "user-789"
}

### 6. 투표하기 - voterId 누락 테스트 (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "choice": "jajang",
  "voterId": ""
}

### 7. 현재 투표 결과 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/result
